      "content": "it's just getting really annoying though. the throat thing isn't even painful, it just feels a bit constricted, like i'm breathing through a straw but i can still get air fine. if i just take an extra dose of Benadryl now, it should kick in fast enough to stop the reaction before it gets worse right? i'm pretty sure i can just sleep it off.",
